# Planning the day: add two tasks to the TODAY project with qt, star an undated one so Today lists it, put it first in Today, and find the same list after reopening.
file <<END
TODAY:
Work:
	- Review PRs
	- Write report @due({today})
END
keys qt
type Call the bank due today
keys <Enter>
status Added to TODAY
keys qt
type Water plants
keys <Enter>
keys gh G k *
keys gt
see - Review PRs 󰓎  Work
keys G k <A-k>
restart
see 󰖙 Today
keys gg x
quit
saved <<END
TODAY:
	- Call the bank @due({today})
	- Water plants
Work:
	- Review PRs @star @done({today})
	- Write report @due({today})
END
